linux-thermal-control (0.5.13-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Keep UEFI Secure Boot and Shim validation enabled by signing acpi_call with
    Ubuntu's machine-owner key and enrolling its public certificate.
  * Add a root-only setup assistant that rebuilds the running-kernel DKMS
    module, queues MOK enrollment, and reports signature status.
  * Require mokutil and shim-signed, emit an actionable post-install notice,
    and remove the remaining disable-or-enroll-key status wording.

